WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:02.300
- Don't say anything offensive

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.717
and be on your best behavior.

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:07.781
Joke about how we shouldn't
talk about politics

00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:09.222
because I know how you can get.

00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:10.861
- Yeah, joke about how I should just run

00:00:10.861 --> 00:00:13.940
because I'm not ready for this.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.857
I'm not ready for this.

00:00:17.731 --> 00:00:19.142
- Oh, my gosh!

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:21.503
Got a little fatter than we remember.

00:00:21.503 --> 00:00:23.064
- Appearing normal, trying to hide the

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:26.303
pain of knowing you've
slept with my daughter.

00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:28.503
Snap judgement based on the handshake.

00:00:28.503 --> 00:00:30.204
Stereotyping you based on your wardrobe

00:00:30.204 --> 00:00:31.484
and your hairstyle.

00:00:31.484 --> 00:00:32.734
Inviting words!

00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:39.555
(intense music)

00:00:43.027 --> 00:00:44.608
- I have never tried to mind

00:00:44.608 --> 00:00:48.228
my manners this much in my entire life.

00:00:48.228 --> 00:00:49.549
- Questioning something that Kelsey put

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.768
on Facebook that makes me realize

00:00:50.768 --> 00:00:53.076
how much I know about you.

00:00:53.076 --> 00:00:54.376
- Embarrassment!

00:00:54.376 --> 00:00:56.857
- And clearly I'm so supportive of it.

00:00:56.857 --> 00:00:59.090
- Yeah, extrapolating
on that because it shows

00:00:59.090 --> 00:00:59.923
some very good.

00:00:59.923 --> 00:01:00.756
- I don't care.

00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:02.716
Can I get some information
about your background?

00:01:02.716 --> 00:01:04.316
I would like to know about your family,

00:01:04.316 --> 00:01:06.216
about your job.

00:01:06.216 --> 00:01:08.396
I need to find out whether we match up.

00:01:08.396 --> 00:01:09.229
- Oh, that reminds me of

00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:10.576
something you have to do with your car.

00:01:10.576 --> 00:01:12.376
- Aggravated short response.

00:01:12.376 --> 00:01:15.949
- Oh, and I'm reminded of
a bill I paid of yours.

00:01:15.949 --> 00:01:16.782
Oh boy, I'll say anything that

00:01:16.782 --> 00:01:19.065
comes into my head.

00:01:19.065 --> 00:01:20.825
- Feeling like I'm in high school again.

00:01:20.825 --> 00:01:22.844
- Avoiding any form of internal conflict

00:01:22.844 --> 00:01:24.420
in order to summarize positive

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.640
things about my upbringing.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.880
Specific details in order to make

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.320
my middle class family feel as

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.240
affluent as I assume yours is.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:33.080
- That phrase reminds me of something,

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.260
oh my God that Kelsey
did when she was little.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:39.040
I was so so so impressed by her.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.880
- Acting on emotions that I haven't

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.420
felt since I lived here.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:44.280
Directing it towards you.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.580
- First impressions are so important

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.260
I just don't wanna be negative.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:50.380
- Reverting back to my high school self.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.213
- I don't need you in the kitchen.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.477
- Abandoning you.

00:02:02.573 --> 00:02:03.660
- Are you the type of person

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:04.680
who likes talking about themselves?

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.780
- No, I have one or two interest but

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:07.933
my goal here is to find out.

00:02:07.933 --> 00:02:09.733
- Desperately trying to connect to you

00:02:09.733 --> 00:02:10.913
on one of those interests.

00:02:10.913 --> 00:02:12.873
- Pretending to believe your attempt.

00:02:12.873 --> 00:02:14.956
And I'll call your bluff.

00:02:16.573 --> 00:02:19.566
- I will actually surprise myself

00:02:19.566 --> 00:02:23.524
by how well I'm currently backtracking.

00:02:23.524 --> 00:02:25.464
- So, you like the same things I do.

00:02:25.464 --> 00:02:27.464
- Definitely like.

00:02:27.464 --> 00:02:28.741
- I planned this whole dinner out

00:02:28.741 --> 00:02:30.881
meticulously and now I'm stressed out

00:02:30.881 --> 00:02:33.321
because it didn't work
out according to plan.

00:02:33.321 --> 00:02:35.586
- Changing the subject to what chores

00:02:35.586 --> 00:02:37.401
you want me to do because I'm

00:02:37.401 --> 00:02:39.501
continuing this contemptuous relationship

00:02:39.501 --> 00:02:42.301
that we use to have when I was 15.

00:02:42.301 --> 00:02:43.961
- And I'm trying to stop that.

00:02:43.961 --> 00:02:45.821
I just want to remind you about

00:02:45.821 --> 00:02:47.924
how much fun we have.

00:02:47.924 --> 00:02:49.091
I love you.

00:02:50.255 --> 00:02:51.535
It's just a general question because

00:02:51.535 --> 00:02:53.895
I'm worried about your well being.

00:02:53.895 --> 00:02:55.075
- So boring you with slides of

00:02:55.075 --> 00:02:56.555
one of my best moments because,

00:02:56.555 --> 00:02:58.495
well, you're basically forced to watch.

00:02:58.495 --> 00:03:01.295
- Over emphasizing how
interesting this is.

00:03:01.295 --> 00:03:03.175
- Oh, and claiming a story as mine

00:03:03.175 --> 00:03:05.555
even though it actually
happened to a friend.

00:03:05.555 --> 00:03:06.975
(laughing)

00:03:06.975 --> 00:03:09.335
- Repeating small phrases while nodding.

00:03:09.335 --> 00:03:11.585
- Oh, and showing you that.

00:03:12.815 --> 00:03:14.845
Hiding that I'm having computer

00:03:14.845 --> 00:03:16.405
problems because of pride.

00:03:16.405 --> 00:03:17.945
- Oh, your making a very simple mistake

00:03:17.945 --> 00:03:19.145
that anyone from my generation

00:03:19.145 --> 00:03:20.585
could help you with.

00:03:20.585 --> 00:03:23.445
- Excuse about other
people using the computer.

00:03:23.445 --> 00:03:24.668
And messing with my stuff.

00:03:24.668 --> 00:03:26.501
- Actually, very, very

00:03:27.814 --> 00:03:31.627
simple thing that everyone knows presented

00:03:31.627 --> 00:03:34.507
like it's an insider's secret.

00:03:34.507 --> 00:03:36.427
- Snap judgement.

00:03:36.427 --> 00:03:39.787
That my other snap judgements were wrong.

00:03:39.787 --> 00:03:41.407
- Taking a breath.

00:03:41.407 --> 00:03:43.407
Becoming an adult again.

00:03:45.245 --> 00:03:47.668
- Look I can't hide that I'm

00:03:47.668 --> 00:03:50.528
unsure about your dreams.

00:03:50.528 --> 00:03:53.228
And you look a little fatter!

00:03:53.228 --> 00:03:54.061
- Mom!

00:03:56.028 --> 00:03:56.861
- I'm so sorry.

00:03:56.861 --> 00:03:57.835
Oh, there I go again.

00:03:57.835 --> 00:03:59.275
- Stomping around because the

00:03:59.275 --> 00:04:01.095
way we communicate is symptomatic

00:04:01.095 --> 00:04:03.075
of a much larger issue.

00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:07.395
- I approve of your choices
but I value security.

00:04:07.395 --> 00:04:10.052
- Pretending I don't
want attention right now.

00:04:10.052 --> 00:04:12.575
- I'm passively siding with your mom

00:04:12.575 --> 00:04:15.095
because them liking me
is much more important

00:04:15.095 --> 00:04:16.595
than whatever you're arguing about.

00:04:16.595 --> 00:04:19.012
- I'm finally feeling needed.

00:04:21.515 --> 00:04:23.495
- Understanding why I'm being

00:04:23.495 --> 00:04:25.795
ganged up on right now and

00:04:25.795 --> 00:04:28.628
willing to go along with the plan.

00:04:29.675 --> 00:04:30.775
- I am impressed with how you

00:04:30.775 --> 00:04:32.955
handled the situation.

00:04:32.955 --> 00:04:35.995
And you can begin to let
your guard down, slowly,

00:04:35.995 --> 00:04:39.245
over the course of the next five years.

